  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Engagement Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP in Bahrain works on accelerating the implementation of youth empowering initiatives, raising awareness amongst youth of the SDGs, and aligning youth initiatives with the Agenda for Sustainable Development. Abdelrahim Alkooheji Foundation (AKF) continues to be a valuable partner to UNDP in investing in the Bahraini youth to drive the achievement of the SDGs. As such, UNDP and AKF seek to further develop their partnership to drive the mission of youth empowerment as partners for development.</narrative>
  </description>
